---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Get Started | Dodo & Co." description="Tell Alexa about your family and book your free 15 to 30 minute intro call with Dodo & Co." current="start">

  <section style="padding-top:56px"><div class="wrap start">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;min-width:0">
      <span class="eyebrow">Get started</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.6vw,64px)">Let's make some room for <em class="soft">rest</em>, together.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Tell me a little about your family and your little one. I'll reach out to set up your free 15 to 30 minute intro call.</p>
      <div class="side-card"><b style="font-family:var(--f-display);font-weight:450;font-size:21px">What happens next</b>
        <ol><li>I read your answers, usually within a day or two.</li><li>We find a time for your intro call.</li><li>If it feels like a fit, I send a short questionnaire and we plan your start date.</li></ol></div>
      <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:16/11"><img src="/img/alexa-smile.jpg" alt="Alexa with her toddler" loading="lazy" style="object-position:55% 40%"></div>
      <blockquote class="mini-quote"><p>“If you are feeling overwhelmed, exhausted, or like you have tried everything, I would absolutely recommend working with her.”</p><cite>Natalie, Dodo &amp; Co. mama</cite></blockquote>
      <div><b>Prefer to message?</b><div class="social" style="margin-top:8px"><a class="btn ghost sm" href="https://www.instagram.com/dodocosleep/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram @dodocosleep</a><a class="btn ghost sm" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@dodocosleep" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok @dodocosleep</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <form class="form" name="intake" method="POST" action="/success" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="intake" />
      <p hidden><label>Skip this: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_name">Your name</label><input id="i_name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_email">Email</label><input id="i_email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_phone">Phone</label><input id="i_phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_city">City</label><input id="i_city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2"></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_baby">Baby's name</label><input id="i_baby" name="baby"></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="i_dob">Baby's birthday</label><input id="i_dob" name="dob" type="date"></div>
      <div class="fld full"><label for="i_now">How does your baby fall asleep today?</label><select id="i_now" name="now"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Nursing or a bottle</option><option>Rocking or bouncing</option><option>Contact naps or holding</option><option>Pacifier</option><option>In the car or stroller</option><option>A mix of these</option><option>On their own, but wakes a lot</option></select></div>
      <div class="fld full"><label for="i_goal">What's the hardest part of sleep right now?</label><textarea id="i_goal" name="goal" placeholder="Short naps, night wakings, early mornings…"></textarea></div>
      <div class="fld full"><label for="i_heard">How did you hear about Dodo &amp; Co.?</label><select id="i_heard" name="heard"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Instagram</option><option>TikTok</option><option>Friend or family</option><option>Pediatrician</option><option>Past client</option><option>Somewhere else</option></select></div>
      <div class="full" style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send to Alexa</button><span class="note">I'll only use this to reach out about your intro call.</span></div>
    </form>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
